1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m25\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommand \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m Now I understand the design. Let me implement the changes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[13C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m6\u001b[21G8\u001b[23G6\u001b[35G\u001b[38;5;248mthinking\u001b[39m\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
